# Warp Generator — Cursor Rules

This is a single-file Cloudflare Worker. All logic is in `_worker.js` (1867 lines). Do NOT split into modules.

## Stack
- Cloudflare Workers (ES2022, no Node.js)
- KV storage only (no D1)
- Dependencies: bcryptjs, @noble/curves, fflate, js-yaml

## Style
- camelCase for functions/variables
- UPPER_SNAKE_CASE for constants
- async/await (no raw Promises)
- Early returns, no deep nesting

## KV Keys
- `account:{uuid}` — accounts
- `token:{token}` — token mappings
- `session:{token}` — sessions
- `settings:password` — bcrypt hash
- `settings:global` — Amnezia defaults
- `presets` — endpoint array

## Validation (SPEC.md AC11)
- Name: 1-100 chars, no control chars
- Port: 1-65535
- Password: 8-128 chars
- Amnezia Jc: 0-200, Jmin/Jmax: 0-1280

## Never
- Store passwords in plaintext
- Log private keys or tokens
- Trust user input without validation
- Add dependencies without checking bundle size

## See CLAUDE.md for full rules
